#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:10002
#: 02fdacc174114c08818c0be1aaaf6cbb
msgid "SegmentTable: Basics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:10005
#: a1cd49f15e3a4a5880d2778d3a237283
msgid ""
"For a more comprehensive guide including visualization, GravitySpy "
"integration, and advanced operations, see the [Table / Segment User "
"Guide](intro_table.ipynb)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:10008
#: 9a28372b82544b409ac26d2de4e6077e
msgid "GWpy base classes and gwexpy extensions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:10010
#: 2909ba1e65db48f18664ed372809366c
msgid ""
"Segment analysis builds on GWpy types. Each row span is still represented by"
" `gwpy.segments.Segment`, and payload columns can hold GWpy `TimeSeries` or "
"`FrequencySeries` objects directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:10012
#: 9062c71d4e5d4a46ad327acdde7917e8
msgid ""
"On top of that, gwexpy adds `SegmentTable` as an extension of "
"`gwpy.table.Table`, plus lazy payload handling via `SegmentCell`, and table-"
"oriented batch helpers such as `apply()`, `map()`, `crop()`, and `asd()`. In"
" practice, you keep GWpy base classes for the actual data objects while "
"gwexpy adds the workflow layer for processing many segments together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:30002
#: d77f6a34dd804f9ba228ac4a9676f11d
msgid "Delayed Loading with SegmentCell"
msgstr "SegmentCell による遅延ロード"

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:30004
#: 9eaa6621b4fa490ea14afd6ff359748e
msgid ""
"You can add payload columns that are only loaded when needed. This is useful"
" for handling large datasets."
msgstr "必要になるまでデータをロードしない「ペイロード列」を追加できます。これは巨大なデータのバッチ処理に非常に有効です。"

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:50002
#: b3cc4c19af544b6fbe37ea8269bf6f1f
msgid "Row-wise Processing"
msgstr "行単位の処理"

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:50004
#: 86dc825478144f13a91afd2505d68611
msgid ""
"`SegmentTable` provides an `apply()` method to process each row and collect "
"results into new columns."
msgstr "`SegmentTable` は `apply()` メソッドを提供し、各行を処理して新しい列として統合できます。"

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:70002
#: 51dcdeb76495420aa4cc33049906f6c3
msgid "Fetch and Conversion"
msgstr "明示的ロードとデータ変換"

#: ../../how-to/segments/intro_segment_table.ipynb:70004
#: 2de50115b91748dab0e52bdd51cd0192
msgid ""
"You can explicitly load lazy cells with `fetch()` or `materialize()`. "
"Converting to pandas gives you a standard DataFrame for meta columns."
msgstr ""
"`fetch()` や `materialize()` を使ってデータを明示的にロードできます。`to_pandas()` を使うと、通常の "
"pandas DataFrame として扱えます。"
